Subject: REMINDER: SIMPLIFIED PAYE RETURN SENSITISATION
To: <novustellafrica21@gmail.com>


*Dear Esteemed Employer*,

Kenya Revenue Authority (KRA) has simplified the PAYE return filing and
payment process, as part of its 9th Corporate Plan's strategic objective to
streamline tax processes and align with best practices.

KRA wishes to inform all employers that the *July 2025* PAYE return should
be filed using the *simplified PAYE return* as guided in the public notice
sent in June 2025. The return is available in the *taxpayer portal* as well
as the KRA Website under 'Publications'.

To improve your knowledge and understanding of the process, the key
changes, and how to manage the transition, you are invited to attend any of
the following sensitisations.

To take part in the sensitisations, please register using the following
links:

*Monday August 4, 2025 at 9:00am - 11:00am*
https://zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_mbpLfodvT6WlV8w8uS1gKA


*Tuesday August 5, 2025 at 9:00am - 11:00am*
https://zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_v_fOX2JlRV-TQVnRkM2kDw


*Additionally, for your further clarification* *please see the links below
for the:*

*Simplified PAYE Training Recordings:*
*https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1LN-ev3oMik&t=4957s*
<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1LN-ev3oMik&t=4957s>
*https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MOUWXsrwga0&t=5071s*
<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MOUWXsrwga0&t=5071s>

*Public Notice:*
*https://www.kra.go.ke/news-center/public-notices/2230-kra-simplifies-the-paye-return-filing-process*
<https://www.kra.go.ke/news-center/public-notices/2230-kra-simplifies-the-paye-return-filing-process>

*Simplified PAYE Return (P10):*
*https://www.kra.go.ke/publications* <https://www.kra.go.ke/publications>


KRA appreciates the feedback and collaboration from taxpayers and will
continue to execute industry specific solutions that support tax compliance.

Reply to *taxpayereducation@kra.go.ke* <kraseminar@kra.go.ke>

Kind regards,

Taxpayer Experience,
Taxpayer Education Forums,
Email: *taxpayereducation@kra.go.ke* <kraseminar@kra.go.ke>

https://www.kra.go.ke/images/KRA-Mail-Disclaimer.pdf
https://www.kra.go.ke/helping-tax-payers/faqs/tax-amnesty-on-interest-and-penalties-for-periods-up-to-31st-december-2023

